From: Justin Michaud <jmichaud@igalia.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:49:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix 32-bit IC register clobbers.

---
 ...get-by-val-buffered-identifier-lifetime.js | 81 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...line-cache-proxy-and-getter-spill-state.js | 17 ++++
 ...-catch-restores-metadata-table-register.js | 22 +++++
 .../bytecode/InlineCacheCompiler.cpp          | 13 ++-
 Source/JavaScriptCore/jit/JITOpcodes.cpp      |  4 +
 5 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 JSTests/stress/get-by-val-buffered-identifier-lifetime.js
